   ladder 2/4 (+ 999 pill idiom); motion ≤240 ms, transform/opacity/border only,
   all prefers-reduced-motion guarded; 44 px touch law on (hover:none). */
.comments{margin-top:clamp(28px,5vh,44px);scroll-margin-top:calc(var(--header-h,54px) + 12px)} /* v0.6.0 fix 5: the .lc-link anchor jump must land the heading below the sticky header (scroll-behavior:smooth already on html) */
